The RGB6 should be capable of
inflicting damage as long as you
aim for the head section.
But you probably won't be able
to land a shot unless you get in
pretty close.
*/
//dv}//v
}//d

//ミサイルは近くでは無効 h //e
resource PO_メタル戦＿ミッソー近く無効__g {
//vox t:vc240381 {
オタコン_000: {
RAYs Raketenzielsystem ist &~uber kurze
